  "spell.hyper_n_hieis_shenanigans.world_cutting_slash.guide": "Chant the three lines: Dragon Scales, Repulsion, Paired Falling Stars. Then the space in front of you is cut, one wide horizontal slash across whatever the crosshair is on. Everything the sheet passes through is severed, whatever armor, resistance or protection it has, and the world is torn open along the cut for a moment before it closes again. The ground is never broken.",
