  "boss.hyper_n_hieis_shenanigans.mahoraga.vow.4": "What it has endured, it endures better. What it is spared, it forgets.",
  "boss.hyper_n_hieis_shenanigans.mahoraga.vow.5": "The city mends itself and gives nothing away. Its ground does not break.",
  "boss.hyper_n_hieis_shenanigans.mahoraga.vow.6": "The scroll burns when the ritual begins. It does not come back.",
